\par 4. \'d0\u7875\'3f \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo vi\u7879\'3fc quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n c\'f3 ch\u7845\'3ft l\'fd\u7907\'3fng (ch\'ednh x\'e1c) y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu:
\par - C\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp (\'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp) ph\u7843\'3fi th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean c\u7911\'3fng c\u7889\'3f c\'f4ng t\'e1c h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1
n kinh t\u7871\'3f: h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n nghi\u7879\'3fp v\u7909\'3f, h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n th\u7889\'3fng k\'ea v\'e0 h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n.
\par - B\u7843\'3fn b\'e1o c\'e1o th\u7889\'3fng k\'ea v\u7873\'3f quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f, nh\u7845\'3ft thi\u7871\'3ft ph\u7843\'3fi c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o ch\u7913
\'3fng t\u7915\'3f ghi ch\'e9p ban \'f0\u7847\'3fu, s\u7893\'3f s\'e1ch h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n th\u7889\'3fng k\'ea k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n v\u7873\'3f\u7911\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd v\'e0 c\'e1c ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845
\'3ft kinh doanh, c\'e1c v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn giao nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft, c\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc kinh t\u7871\'3f k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft do c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean duy\u7879\'3ft v
\'e0 c\'e1c h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f.
\par - B\u7843\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp (c\'f5 quan qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 \'fd c}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 \u7845\'3fp tr\'ean) ph\u7843\'3fi tr\'ean c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\'e1c b\u7843\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v
\u7883\'3f c\u7845\'3fp d\'fd\u7899\'3fi, tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp s\u7889\'3f li\u7879\'3fu t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp kh\'e1c v\u7899\'3fi s\u7889\'3f li\u7879\'3fu trong b\'e1o c\'e1o th\u7889\'3fng k\'ea v\u7873\'3f quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v
\u7853\'3ft t\'fd c\u7911\'3fa c\u7845\'3fp m}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 \'ecnh th\'ec ph\u7843\'3fi nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu v\'e0 l\'e0m th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af575 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f575\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ch\u7881\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f li\u7879\'3fu (th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft gi\u7919\'3fa b\'e1}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 o c\'e1o th\u7889
\'3fng k\'ea v\'e0 quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n). 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 - C\'f5 quan qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 \'fd c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi
