\'fd
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 1. Sau khi b\'e1o c\'e1o l\'ean c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean c\u7911\'3fa 2 b\'ean (cung \u7913\'3fng v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng), c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 \'e1c c\'f4ng ty (x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp) cung \u7913\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc quy\u7873\'3fn t\u7841\'3fm ng\u7915\'3fng cung \u7913\'3fng \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi nh\u7919\'3fng 
\'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f:
\par - C\'f3 v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd t\u7891\'3fn kho qu\'e1 l\u7899\'3fn so v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc d\u7921\'3f tr\u7919\'3f t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af575 \ltrch\fcs0 \f575\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 - Vi ph\u7841\'3fm ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f ch\'ednh s\'e1ch v\u7873\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 \'fd nh\'fd: d\'f9ng v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd sai m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch ghi trong k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch. S\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc duy\u7879\'3ft, \'f0em b\'e1n l\u7841\'3f
i v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi theo k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch ho\u7863\'3fc mua c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc cho t\'fd th\'fd\'f5ng ho\u7863\'3fc \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f kh\'e1c \'f0\u7875\'3f ki
\u7871\'3fm ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1, kh\'f4ng giao n\u7897\'3fp s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm \'f0\'fang s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng, ch\u7845\'3ft l\'fd\u7907\'3fng theo h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 \'e3 k\'fd m\'e0 kh\'f4ng c\'f3 l\'fd do ch\'ednh}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af575 \ltrch\fcs0 \f575\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428  \'f0\'e1ng.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 - Kh\'f4ng ho\'e0n th\'e0nh k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh (tr\u7915\'3f tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp kh\'f4ng ho\'e0n th\'e0nh k\u7871
\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch do y\u7871\'3fu t\u7889\'3f v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd).
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 Khi x\u7917\'3f l\'fd ng\u7915\'3fng cung \u7913\'3fng, hai b\'ean (cung \u7913\'3fng v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng) g\u7863\'3fp nhau l\'e0m cam k\u7871\'3ft b\'e1o c\'e1o l
\'ean c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean r\u7891\'3fi m\u7899\'3fi }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp ti\u7871\'3fp.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 2. C\'e1c B\u7897\'3f cung \u7913\'3fng }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc quy\u7873\'3fn thu h\u7891\'3fi v
\u7853\'3ft t\'fd tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp n\'e3m sau kh\'f4ng c\'f3 ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd ho\u7863\'3fc tr\u7915\'3f v\'e0o ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd n\'e3m sau \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi nh\u7919\'3fng \'f0\'f5
n v\u7883\'3f kh\'f4ng ho\'e0n th\'e0nh k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch giao n\u7897\'3fp s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm cho Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f c\'f5 quan (c\u7845\'3fp) giao ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau v
\u7853\'3ft t\'fd gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft c\u7845\'3fp b\'f9 v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd cho nh\u7919\'3fng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f giao n\u7897\'3fp s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm v\'fd\u7907\'3ft k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch.
\par 3.C\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc c\'e1 nh\'e2n c\'f3 th\'e0nh t\'edch s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng ti\u7871\'3ft ki\u7879\'3fm n\'e3ng l\'fd\u7907\'3fng, nguy\'ean nhi\'ean v\u7853\'3ft li\u7879\'3fu so v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3f
c Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc qui \'f0\u7883\'3fnh, s\u7869\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc khen th\'fd\u7903\'3fng b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn. Ng\'fd\u7907\'3fc l\u7841\'3fi, n\u7871\'3fu s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\'fd\u7907\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc s
\u7869\'3f b\u7883\'3f c\u7855\'3ft gi\u7843\'3fm t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi l\u7907\'3fi nhu\u7853\'3fn v\'e0 l\u7853\'3fp 3 qu\'ed c\u7911\'3fa x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp, d\u7921\'3fa tr\'ean qui \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f
 v\u7873\'3f th\'fd\u7903\'3fng ph\u7841\'3ft th\u7921\'3fc h\'e0nh ti\u7871\'3ft ki\u7879\'3fm do B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh ban h\'e0nh (theo tinh th\u7847\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Ngh\u7883\'3f quy\u7871\'3ft 15-H\'d0BT ng\'e0y 8/2/82).
\par 4. Nh\u7919\'3fng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh kh\'f4ng th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, kh\'f4ng g\u7917\'3fi b\'e1o c\'e1o th\u7889\'3fng k\'ea v\u7873\'3f
 quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd cho: c\'f5 quan cung \u7913\'3fng, ng\'e0nh th\u7889\'3fng k\'ea v\'e0 c\'e1c n\'f5i nh\u7853\'3fn kh\'e1c theo qui \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f b\'e1o c\'e1o th\u7889\'3fng k\'ea v
