}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15275884\charrsid5637428 \u7853\'3fp qu\u297\'3f khen th\'fd\u7903\'3fng v\'e0 qu\u297\'3f ph\'fac l\u7907\'3fi h\'e0ng qu\'ed v\'e0 h\'e0ng n\'e3m, c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
